title: Doubling Back
text: Some light has to come home before it can go out.
trick: red and green leave the prism by different sides, run round a reflector-bender triangle inside the house in opposite directions, re-enter the prism and leave together as one yellow beam that draws the roof; cyan is the prism's blue crossed by that yellow after a multi-filter
motif: pictogram (a house: walls, floor and chimney; the solved yellow beam draws the roof)
expect: merges>=2
---
L 0 7 2 w
T 10 4 0 ?
T 6 11 0 ?
T 13 7 0 ?
*P 3 7 0 k
*R 3 11 3 k
*B 7 11 1 k
*R 8 2 6 k
*M 12 6 2 k
